{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1358624-aeon-ftl-communications","id":1358624,"title":"[Aeon] FTL Communications","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: \u00c6on"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-01-03T08:14:37-08:00","id":1358624,"title":"[Aeon] FTL Communications","content":"What is the state of tech in Aeon about FTL communications? I could find information on intra-planet communications, but not much in the books. <br /> <br /> First of all, would FTL communication be instantaneous, or would it follow the teleportation time?<br /> <br /> - We know they have FTL transport, but that is mostly dependent on the Upeo. They have the leviathans, and they are major technological breakthroughs for now. Communications can be done in a 'Pony Express' way, with data in stored, portable format being swapped in chunks.<br /> <br /> - Telepathy is off unless you use it in conjunction with a clear to get interstellar range. And still, there is still a somewhat limited range. There could be biotech that boosted telepathic communication, but I've never seen mention of that. With so many lightyears in range, hubs and repeaters could be a workaround. But that would need a somewhat decent infrastructure. <br /> <br /> - Another option would have open gates as connection points. This could be done with dedicated Upeos, and with biotech gates. Both solutions are very expensive. <br /> <br /> In my case, I made a decision that there are no practical FTL communications, at least as far as the frontier is concerned. So far, it is only the first option, with me considering if the closer core worlds only being connected by boosted telepaths. <br /> <br /> How do you make FTL communications work in your game?<br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1524-pcontop","name":"pcontop","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1524_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"278"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T09:34:49-08:00","id":1358633,"title":"","content":"As I understand, one Telepath working in a Network with a Clairscentient can reach 20-50ly Instant communication.<br /> <br /> That\u2019s why many of the extra solar colonies were out of reach (not just unreachable from the lack of teleport).<br /> <br /> I would make a Telepath network to reach... they are not machines, but would be working as \u201cradio operators\u201d for the colonies at reach, contacting the colony leaders from time to time to get the news.<br /> <br /> Its possible to do the same combination with a EK working with a Clair to reach computers for reports from time to time, but you are dependent of Psions or at least biotech.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481584/house-rules-bundle-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">House Rules - The Bundle</a> - House Rules for Everyone<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/481581/powered-inspiration-bundle\" target=\"_blank\">Powered Inspired</a> - Powered Characters using Inspiration and Gifts<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/413362/Fists-and-Tomes-BUNDLE\" target=\"_blank\">Fists and Tomes</a> - Inspired Martial Arts and Mysticism for Talents<br /> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492147/supertech\" target=\"_blank\">Supertech</a> - Super Science in the hands of Talents","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24985-mateus-luz","name":"Mateus Luz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24985_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2950"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-01-03T15:06:30-08:00","id":1358711,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pcontop</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1358624-aeon-ftl-communications#post1358624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is the state of tech in Aeon about FTL communications? I could find information on intra-planet communications, but not much in the books.</div> </div> </div> </div>The answer from the state of the universe as set in the books is telepathy, teleporting couriers, and clairsentient scrapers, with the various challenges and limitations around those, which you\u2019ve touched on.<br /> <br /> AEon\u2019s universe evokes a lot of different sci fi genres, and \u2018isolated space frontier\u2019 is one of them as well. The universe has near instant OpNet for communications around the world, slight delays within the system, but knowing what is going on out in the colonies takes time and effort.<br /> <br /> You can be guaranteed that various corporations are working on the issue of creating an ARES equivalent for telepaths to boost to interstellar range without needing a clear, or working to make \u2018biotech radios\u2019 that open communications at vast distances using telepathic \u2018frequencies\u2019.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>pcontop</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-\u00e6on/1358624-aeon-ftl-communications#post1358624\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> First of all, would FTL communication be instantaneous, or would it follow the teleportation time?</div> </div> </div> </div>I\u2019d say instantaneous, but you can run with what works for your game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Writer. Developer.</i> <b>World of Darkness</b> | <b>Chronicles of Darkness</b> | <b>The Trinity Continuum</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/156-bunyip","name":"Bunyip","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1880"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}